This distribution includes benchmark tasks, mock tools, verifiers, and
documentation released under the Apache License 2.0.

The benchmark runs on Harbor, which is a separate dependency and is not
redistributed here. Several mock-tool interfaces follow Apache-2.0 metadata.

Frozen public market data used by the trading scenarios retains its own
provenance records under:

  cavebench/skills/trading/data/market/PROVENANCE.md

Copies vendored into individual task environments include the same provenance
record. No credentials or private exchange data are included.
